---
name: Reconcile OSINT context with isMalicious feeds
description: |
  Walks the isMalicious domain and IP collections daily and updates the shared
  `ocsf-osint` lookup table from the Tenzir utilities package. Run it together
  with the polling example, which picks up additions and revocations between
  walks.
---

// Runs at 07:00 in the node's local time zone, after the nightly provider
// reload that starts at 02:00 UTC.
cron "0 0 7 * * *" {
  from {collection: "malicious-domains"}, {collection: "malicious-ips"}
  // Walk one collection at a time to stay within the API rate limit.
  each parallel=1 {
    ismalicious::feed $this.collection,
      api_credential=secret("ISMALICIOUS_API_CREDENTIAL"),
      params={min_score: 60}
  }
  ismalicious::ocsf::normalize
  tenzir::osint::update_context max_age=30d
}
